@startuml
!include style.puml
title Doc Pup - Request Ownership, Processing and Cancellation
autonumber
actor User
participant "Browser / Doc Pup JS" as UI
participant "docpup.api" as API
participant "In-process JOBS / locks" as Jobs
participant "Extract / ASR / answer helpers" as Helpers
participant "Ollama / Qwen3" as LLM
participant "Speech subprocess" as Speech
User -> UI : Request briefing, form fill, transcription or reading
UI -> API : POST /docpup/{action}/\nCSRF + task ID + request ID + data/file
API -> API : Require login and POST; parse object; validate task ID
API -> API : Read policy; check enabled, action and round limits
API -> Jobs : Register Event under\n(user.pk, session_key, task, request)
API -> Jobs : Acquire LOCK (non-TTS) or SPEECH_LOCK (TTS, capacity 3)\nwait at most 10 seconds; check cancellation
alt invalid / duplicate / busy / cancelled
  API --> UI : 400 {error}
else acquired
  alt action=brief
    API -> API : Build server-side authorized context\nmember: own data; admin: permitted page context
    API -> LLM : summarize(); chunk if context too large\nstream /api/chat; output JSON
    LLM --> API : Grounded summary text
  else action=file or asr
    API -> Helpers : Exactly one file; extract within policy limits
    Helpers -> Helpers : Audio -> cancellable Whisper CPU subprocess\nPDF/TXT/DOCX -> text extraction
    Helpers --> API : Source text
    opt action=file
      API -> API : Merge evidence; require entry page and known kind
    end
  else action=answer
    API -> Helpers : Check skip phrase; attempt direct_answer()
    Helpers --> API : Skip / validated direct answer / unresolved
  else action=tts
    API -> Speech : Spawn worker(text[:500], lang, voice catalog)
    Speech -> Speech : Try Edge TTS -> MP3\nfallback Windows SAPI -> WAV
    Speech --> API : Audio file (45-second supervisor deadline)
  end
  opt file or unresolved answer
    loop source fragments of 1200 characters, 150-character overlap
      loop batches of two field descriptors
        API -> LLM : llm(prompt, fields + source, Event)\nJSON output schema
        LLM --> API : Candidate answers + clarification question
        API -> Helpers : validated(schema, result, fragment)
        Helpers --> API : Evidence-supported normalized answers
      end
    end
    API -> API : Remove conflicting field values
  end
  group finally (also on processing errors)
    opt model was used
      API -> LLM : /api/generate keep_alive=0 (best effort)
    end
    API -> Jobs : Release lock; remove job
    API -> API : Clear request data; temporary directories close
  end
  API --> UI : JSON text / answers / skip / evidence, or audio bytes
end
UI --> User : Display result / play audio / populate controls
note over API,Jobs
  Cancellation is an interrupting concurrent request, not a step after success.
  See interaction 13 for the separate cancellation scenario.
  JOBS and locks are process-local; no persistent queue or task table exists.
end note
note over User,UI
  Form fill does not save Record. User reviews and submits separately.
  File extraction: policy size limit (default 20 MB); text <=60000 chars;
  PDF <=100 pages, no encryption or image-only input; audio <=600 seconds
  for file mode; DOCX expanded size <=40 MB. No OCR path is implemented.
  PupError -> 400; unexpected exception -> generic 503.
end note
@enduml
